      "title": "Director Studio · Layout · Read first",
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Layout reference frame\n\nUpload all three reference images: Image1 = scene, Image2 = actor, Image3 = prop. Edit the composition prompt to assign each image its role. This export represents the main three-reference path; unused references must be removed from both the encoder and latent-conditioning chains.\n\n1728 x 960 canvas · Lightning 4 steps · CFG 1 · Euler/simple · denoise 1. Full-resolution VAE references are attached twice to positive conditioning and once to zero-negative conditioning. The first reference latent initializes sampling. The encoder intentionally has no VAE input.\n\nOutput is a composition reference, not a guaranteed video first frame."
      ]
